                            <div class="tab-text">
                                <h3>Heat Recovery Steam Generator (HRSG) Inspection</h3>
                                <p>Combined cycle power plants rely on HRSG systems to convert gas turbine exhaust heat into steam for steam turbine generation. HRSG tube failures disrupt entire plant output (400-800 MW typical) causing $2M-5M per day lost revenue. NFT enables rapid tube inspection during short planned outages (7-14 days typical) without extensive disassembly, detecting FAC, thermal fatigue, corrosion fatigue, and steam-side oxidation before failure.</p>
